.Dd November 9, 2026
.Dt WESTON-CLIENTS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm weston-clients
.Nd run Weston example clients
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Weston's example clients draw, accept input, exercise protocol extensions and demonstrate rendering paths.
They connect to the socket named by
.Ev WAYLAND_DISPLAY
under
.Ev XDG_RUNTIME_DIR .
.Nm weston-simple-shm
uses shared memory;
.Nm weston-simple-egl
uses EGL;
.Nm weston-terminal
runs a terminal.
Programs with dmabuf in their name also need a usable DRM render node.
.Nm wcap-decode
reads Weston's captured output.
